cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tabularium in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Tabularium: An Owner-Judged Agent Framework"
authors:
  - family-names: Tong
    given-names: Hogan
version: 0.5.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tonguso/tabularium"
abstract: >-
  A framework for a small cast of personal agents on Telegram whose work is judged by their owner.
  Tasks carry requirements with verifiable checks, delegation is by contract, memory is reviewed, and lessons
  change methods only after a trial and the owner's word. The repository holds the runtime, the evaluation
  benchmark and the design record.
keywords:
  - agents
  - evaluation
  - human-in-the-loop
  - personal assistant
